    "notes": "Sym branding and first-party in-app updates on all five packages. Real installed beta.12-to-QA-successor upgrades passed with retained OS-encrypted synthetic data, integrity rejection and Debian authorization denial/recovery. Mac apps are signed, notarized and stapled; Windows remains an unsigned preview. Display targets are Observe-only. Unqualified broad Computer Control, Wayland paths and an independent second cursor remain outside this release. Older installations may need one final manual install; no automatic migration of existing customers is claimed.",
